o choose from too which will automically pick up the data corresponding to the tag.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.944; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br></p><ol style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.62; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: 400;\">Please navigate to the Workspace&gt;Communication&gt;Bulk email section.</span></p></li></ol><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">As seen in the below image there are the new tokens on the right hand side which can be dragged and dropped into the email as needed into the email to customise it.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:404px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9180108965/original/r9kQ1BKk9t4wgYyspilkW935a7qCo8jMWA.png?1676451236\" width=\"602\" height=\"404\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9180108965\"></span></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">2. &nbsp;Client Type Filter:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">As seen in the below image, the client type filter can be used t